{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Moondrills</strong> \u2014 a competitive action game. You and your rivals land on an asteroid with one goal: gather enough resources, <strong>meet your extraction quota</strong>, and get back home. But victory won\u2019t come easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/extras/1c3627b0c5085959284532c1ff4a5cc8.poster.avif?t=1759534303\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/extras/1c3627b0c5085959284532c1ff4a5cc8.webm?t=1759534303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/extras/1c3627b0c5085959284532c1ff4a5cc8.mp4?t=1759534303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drill pixel by pixel</strong>, collect ore, and use it to upgrade yourself and recharge your weapons. You can\u2019t max out every stat, so choose wisely between drill power, health, speed, inventory size or damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If peaceful mining bores you\u2014or you just want to take out all your friends\u2014arm yourself with gadgets scattered across the asteroid: <strong>Turret</strong>, <strong>Mines</strong>, <strong>Dash</strong>, or <strong>Shield</strong>\u2014and eliminate the competition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/extras/4f7c01b59690bae4312a75a9f4e4ee20.poster.avif?t=1759534303\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/extras/4f7c01b59690bae4312a75a9f4e4ee20.webm?t=1759534303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/extras/4f7c01b59690bae4312a75a9f4e4ee20.mp4?t=1759534303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel by Pixel Mining</strong>: Tear through the surface to uncover the richest veins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade System</strong>: Turn ore into upgrades for drill power, health, speed, inventory size, or damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Gadgets</strong>: Find gadgets that aid in mining or let you take out\u2014and defend against\u2014other players. Among them: the <strong>Black Hole</strong>, the <strong>Evil Gnome</strong>, the <strong>Hungry Worm</strong>, <strong>Deus ex Machina</strong>, and many others!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Matches</strong>: Each game lasts just 10\u201315 minutes\u2014no time to get bored!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split-screen multiplayer</strong> for up to 6 players, plus online play via Steam Remote Play Together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo mode</strong> with\u00a0multiple types of enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a casual hangout with friends or an all\u2011out competitive showdown? Join <strong>Moondrills</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warnings:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one player can use keyboard and mouse. Other players need to use controllers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not support online multiplayer. Playing together over the internet is possible only via Steam Remote Play.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hard Worker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1860290/c44d035c69835c5ffac797ba6884adb3fc1b21b4.jpg"},{"name":"Mmm, Looks Tasty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1860290/9374c1272dedf5db81721b3b1ebfd1259b32c428.jpg"},{"name":"Gotcha!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1860290/73244472a3d49a8c2cb1db0b07c2e7717e9b9d74.jpg"},{"name":"Magnetism","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1860290/2dce12d0b1b42a2eb0660583536b8850c746130c.jpg"},{"name":"Bait","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1860290/4adfaecb6e738cf101c6aaee41c15d2c9d6a8441.jpg"},{"name":"Vacuum Cleaner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1860290/aebbe3d3fac0ed6036e01cebf3b266f5e1323bf1.jpg"},{"name":"Hyperactive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1860290/3be49539780eb7ad707689c1d0420d4e070fbdb6.jpg"},{"name":"Mine Mine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1860290/6216a727ffbdcf828d275635678a674dfe85f8d6.jpg"},{"name":"Unidentified Shooting Object","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1860290/ff1ba1bbda931af9e2febcdd51db6312654b4394.jpg"},{"name":"Rock and Stone!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1860290/19c341aa29f489d5379b0b3d6a3cd6eb5a2302ea.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1860290?t=1759534303","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/13fd6bbf65dd5d57c446fb219df11a20209e44ad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759534303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/db80e76f95ec328a835fb874e607219f9ba69c4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759534303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/db80e76f95ec328a835fb874e607219f9ba69c4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759534303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4068340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Moondrills</strong> \u2014 a competitive action game. You and your rivals land on an asteroid with one goal: gather enough resources, <strong>meet your extraction quota</strong>, and get back home. But victory won\u2019t come easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/extras/1c3627b0c5085959284532c1ff4a5cc8.poster.avif?t=1759534303\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/extras/1c3627b0c5085959284532c1ff4a5cc8.webm?t=1759534303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/extras/1c3627b0c5085959284532c1ff4a5cc8.mp4?t=1759534303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drill pixel by pixel</strong>, collect ore, and use it to upgrade yourself and recharge your weapons. You can\u2019t max out every stat, so choose wisely between drill power, health, speed, inventory size or damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If peaceful mining bores you\u2014or you just want to take out all your friends\u2014arm yourself with gadgets scattered across the asteroid: <strong>Turret</strong>, <strong>Mines</strong>, <strong>Dash</strong>, or <strong>Shield</strong>\u2014and eliminate the competition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/extras/4f7c01b59690bae4312a75a9f4e4ee20.poster.avif?t=1759534303\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/extras/4f7c01b59690bae4312a75a9f4e4ee20.webm?t=1759534303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/extras/4f7c01b59690bae4312a75a9f4e4ee20.mp4?t=1759534303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel by Pixel Mining</strong>: Tear through the surface to uncover the richest veins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade System</strong>: Turn ore into upgrades for drill power, health, speed, inventory size, or damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Gadgets</strong>: Find gadgets that aid in mining or let you take out\u2014and defend against\u2014other players. Among them: the <strong>Black Hole</strong>, the <strong>Evil Gnome</strong>, the <strong>Hungry Worm</strong>, <strong>Deus ex Machina</strong>, and many others!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Matches</strong>: Each game lasts just 10\u201315 minutes\u2014no time to get bored!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split-screen multiplayer</strong> for up to 6 players, plus online play via Steam Remote Play Together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo mode</strong> with\u00a0multiple types of enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a casual hangout with friends or an all\u2011out competitive showdown? Join <strong>Moondrills</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warnings:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one player can use keyboard and mouse. Other players need to use controllers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not support online multiplayer. Playing together over the internet is possible only via Steam Remote Play.</p></li></ul>","developers":["QnQ Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860290/9c00b72f391074bfa5cb7383d762819b8487bf64/header.jpg?t=1759534303","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1860290/1631665185/f079ca2c7da97261b5e1590badcae715b4bc9459/1758996080/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758997507","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1860290/1631665185/f079ca2c7da97261b5e1590badcae715b4bc9459/1758996080/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758997507","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1860290/1631665185/f079ca2c7da97261b5e1590badcae715b4bc9459/1758996080/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758997507","id":257207532,"name":"Solo mode Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257207532/ed7849664af2b4c9c7244c351de97bf75ebdd9e0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758997507"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1860290/1081966002/682163ac00916b96f418abefc269b006bdcd291f/1751460104/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752249446","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1860290/1081966002/682163ac00916b96f418abefc269b006bdcd291f/1751460104/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752249446","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://vide